---
description: Keep exact pagetables before point-based charts
alwaysApply: true
---

# Result table ordering

- Every pagetable or row-based data display must appear before every chart
  that plots individual points.
- Pagetables include recent placements, time and day-category rankings such
  as "on weekends", board-shape rankings, streak, near-streak, and
  near-near-streak.
- Point charts include grouped average-time scatterplots and raw relationship
  scatterplots.
- Preserve this sequence in both DOM and visual order:
  placements → rankings → streaks → average-time charts → relationship charts.
- Responsive wrapping must stay within each semantic section and must not
  interleave a pagetable with point charts.
